<title>POLAND: RELPOL GROUP MARCH NET AT PLN 1 MLN.</title>
<headline>RELPOL GROUP MARCH NET AT PLN 1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Group net profit	     1.02 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 1.39 vs   0.62</p>
<p> Group operating profit     0.60 vs   0.38</p>
<p> Group sales		    8.17 vs   3.17</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Group net profit	     3.15 vs   1.37</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 4.74 vs   2.04</p>
<p> Group operating profit     3.27 vs   1.55</p>
<p> Group sales		   22.39 vs  10.13</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish electromagnetic transmitter</p>
<p>maker is Relpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
